lemma transSpan (h:i ≤j)(x:Cover): ratioTo (ladder P₀ A) j i=Counter.stampR P₀ A i j:=by unfold ratioTo Counter.stampR; rw[ladders,ladders]
-- arithmetic sap from initial sep Mih.Eliminate via injectivity at initial root. ST.BASE parity any. crafted.
lemma ample (h:i ≤ j)(x y:Cover): separation (wrap (A.ring (B.n k) j) (lineC (ladder P₀ A) 0 i x j)) (wrap (A.ring (B.n k) j) (lineC (ladder P₀ A) 0 i y j)) = ratioTo (ladder P₀ A) j i * separation (wrap (A.ring (B.n k) i) x) (wrap (A.ring (B.n k) i) y):=by
      let R:=Counter.Tiler.knit P₀ A ϱ h
      have hg(v:Cover): wrap (A.ring ϱ j) (lineC (ladder P₀ A) 0 i v j)=R.embed (wrap _ v):=by change wrap _ (0+_) =R.embed _; rw [zero_add, Ratio.embed_wrap,show R.count.val=ratioTo _ _ _ from (transSpan P₀ A h v).symm]
      rw [hg,hg, Next.Rank.Station.both,transSpan P₀ A h x]; rfl
